3'h2 & {\tt ADD} & Add two numbers   \\\hline
3'h3 & {\tt CMP}  & Compare \\\hline
3'h4 & {\tt LW} & Load 32-bit word\\\hline
3'h5 & {\tt SW} & Store 32-bit word\\\hline
